############ AC3: INVALID / MISSING / PRECEDENCE ############
-- (a) invalid token in BOTH header + query --
body: {"errors":[{"code":"token","message":"The selected token is invalid."}]}
-- (b) NO token at all --
{"errors":[{"code":"token","message":"The token field is required."}]}
>>>HTTP 401
-- (c) precedence: valid HEADER + garbage ?token= → 200 as header's DM --
{"id":1,"f_name":"Ali","l_name":"Hassan","phone":"+971565656656","email":"ali.hassan@demo.com","identity_number":"DL1234
>>>HTTP 200
-- (d) edge: array token ?token[]= (non-scalar guard) → 401, not 500 --
{"errors":[{"code":"token","message":"The token field is required."}]}
>>>HTTP 401
